<title>USA: Drypers to buy contract manufacturer.</title>
<headline>Drypers to buy contract manufacturer.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drypers Corp said Wednesday it has reached an agreement to acquire Pannolini de Mexico SA de CV, its contract manufacturer in Mexico.</p>
<p>The company did not say when it expected the deal to close. However, it said the acquisition is expected to be &quot;modestly accretive&quot; to earnings beginning in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Drypers said the deal should improve its profitability and expand its market share in Mexico.</p>
</text>
